            "line": 203,
            "text": "theorem FallSegs.pos : ∀ {segs : List (ℝ × ℝ)} {h : ℝ}, FallSegs h segs → ∀ p ∈ segs, 0 < p.2\n  | [], _, _, p, hp => by simp at hp\n  | (c, m) :: rest, _, hs, p, hp => by\n    obtain ⟨-, hm, hrest⟩ :="
